  m_text: '<size=150%>THE LAST SIGNAL</size>


    A university game project



    <b>Game design & development</b>

    Anujan N


    <b>Characters</b>

    Alex

    Maya

    The Echo


    <b>Built with</b>

    Unity 6 - Universal Render Pipeline

    Claude Code + Unity MCP


    <b>Sound effects</b>

    Kenney (kenney.nl) - CC0

    Joseph Sardin (BigSoundBank / LaSonotheque) - CC0

    OpenGameArt.org contributors - CC0

    "Rain and Thunder Loop" by DoKashiteru - CC BY 3.0

    "Heartbeat" by HerbertBoland (Wikimedia Commons) - CC BY 3.0

    CC BY 3.0: creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0


    <b>Art</b>

    Textures: Poly Haven (polyhaven.com) - CC0

    The Echo body and animations: Quaternius, Universal Animation Library - CC0


    <b>Fonts</b>

    Liberation Sans (TextMeshPro)



    For everyone who is still listening.



    Thank you for playing.'
